{"id": "EUVD-2026-107894", "enisaUuid": "bfd8a58c-73b7-3b45-8ba9-1f448cce7967", "description": "Traefik 2.11.0 before 2.11.58 and 3.0.0 before 3.7.14 contains an authentication bypass because a first request preauthenticated with an Authorization: Negotiate token authenticates a socket in the globally shared backend connection pool, which is never isolated. Unauthenticated attackers on separate frontend connections can be assigned that NTLM/Kerberos-bound socket and perform reads or writes with the victim's identity.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T01:43:39", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T01:43:39", "baseScore": 7.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:N/SC:H/SI:H/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/traefik/traefik/security/advisories/GHSA-qm9f-w54v-q2qh", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/traefik-before-2.11.58-and-3.7.14-authentication-bypass-via-negotiate-connection-pool"], "aliases": ["GHSA-wx2g-x89x-v9j3", "CVE-2026-114639"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.31, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "3dcbe451-3120-3e79-9236-bb385dbfe69e", "product": {"name": "traefik", "vendor": {"name": "traefik"}}, "product_version": "3.0.0 <3.7.14"}, {"id": "51996ffe-acfb-3f0a-84e5-b0491cd3bbf0", "product": {"name": "traefik", "vendor": {"name": "traefik"}}, "product_version": "2.11.0 <2.11.58"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "14aaeb91-6ee0-3b65-8433-3681a30e093f", "vendor": {"name": "traefik"}}], "isExploited": false}